{"id": "69665", "title": "毒欢", "author": "黎沫染", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69665.htm", "intro": "一味宠爱换来无情背叛，一样圣洁的面容却藏着一颗肮脏的心。\r\n骤雨夜，豪车内，宋芷青衣不蔽体，她用尽一切证明自己清白，却被殷黎森无情丢弃……\r\n一场骗局，豪门婚姻终破灭，身心俱疲，正妻沦为情妇，却还要被他不断索取。\r\n他说，她只是替代品中的一个，这个游戏只有他才有资格喊停。他还说，这辈子她只能躺在他的床上承欢。\r\n他威胁她，再敢逃一次，我就当着你最爱的男人前面做你，好让他看看我们的身体是多么地有默契。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69665", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10670465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-12", "file": "10670466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-18", "file": "10670467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-25", "file": "10670468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-32", "file": "10670469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-38", "file": "10670470.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-45", "file": "10670471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-51", "file": "10670472.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-57", "file": "10670473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-62", "file": "10670474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-67", "file": "10670475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "68-72", "file": "10670476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "73-76", "file": "10670477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-80", "file": "10670478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10670479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "10670480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "10670481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "10670482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "10670483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "10670484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-115", "file": "10670485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-120", "file": "10670486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-125", "file": "10670487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "126-130", "file": "10670488.html", "avai